{{!
    @template format_aicourse/section_icon

    The icon box of a section card. Included twice by format_aicourse/section_card: once wrapped in
    the icon picker <button> when edit mode is on, and once bare when it is off.

    Three states are possible: the teacher's chosen icon, a pencil placeholder (edit mode, no icon
    chosen yet) and a neutral question mark (view mode, no icon chosen). All three are decorative
    and therefore carry aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"; the accessible name lives on the icon
    picker button in edit mode, and there is nothing to announce in view mode.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-card-icon-wrap - the icon picker swaps aicourse-icon-selected / aicourse-icon-empty
      on this element after a successful save.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * None.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasicon bool True when the teacher has chosen an icon for this section.
    * isediting bool True when the teacher has edit mode turned on.
    * iconsvg string PRE-ESCAPED SVG child markup from \format_aicourse\local\icons::get_library().
      This is plugin-defined constant markup, never user input, so it is rendered with a triple
      mustache; it is only used when hasicon is true.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasicon": true,
        "isediting": false,
        "iconsvg": "<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/>"
    }
}}
<div class="aicourse-card-icon-wrap {{#hasicon}}aicourse-icon-selected{{/hasicon}}{{^hasicon}}aicourse-icon-empty{{/hasicon}}">
{{#hasicon}}
<div class="aicourse-card-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24">{{{iconsvg}}}</svg></div>
{{/hasicon}}
{{^hasicon}}
<div class="aicourse-card-icon">{{#isediting}}<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 3a2.85 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5Z"/></svg>{{/isediting}}{{^isediting}}<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><text x="12" y="16" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="500" fill="currentColor">?</text></svg>{{/isediting}}</div>
{{/hasicon}}
</div>
